{"seq":3,"slug":"recovery-writeoff-cost-leakage","title":"费用追回、核销与成本泄漏分析（追回率/预提/供应商对账）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/container-demurrage-detention-port-cost-management/invoice-audit-dispute-recovery/recovery-writeoff-cost-leakage","wordCount":3629,"readingTime":15,"html":"<h1 id=\"费用追回-核销与成本泄漏分析-追回率-预提-供应商对账\">费用追回、核销与成本泄漏分析（追回率/预提/供应商对账）</h1><p>一笔 D&amp;D 费用的「追回」并不是一次转账，而是同一笔钱在三种形态之间的转换：承运人口头或书面的<strong>减免承诺</strong>、可入账的<strong>贷项通知（credit note）</strong>、以及最终落到银行账户的<strong>现金回款</strong>。三种形态在财务报表上分属不同科目，在系统里却是同一张工单的三个状态。把它们混为一谈，是 D&amp;D 成本治理里最普遍、也最昂贵的错误——报表上的追回率冲上去了，账上的现金却没有变，缺口被悄悄记进了「其他费用」。这一篇讲的就是如何把「已经算出争议金额」（见 <a href=\"dd-invoice-data-model-audit-rules\">滞箱费账单数据模型与自动稽核规则引擎</a>）与「已经提交申诉」（见 <a href=\"dd-dispute-filing-evidence-package\">争议申诉流程设计与证据包构建</a>）之后的最后一公里——追回、核销、以及泄漏分析——做成可对账、可审计的系统。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-五个先对齐的术语\">核心概念：五个先对齐的术语</h2><p>这套系统的混乱，多数源于把不同层次的名词当成同义词使用。在展开任何计算之前，先把下面五个术语界定清楚，否则「追回率」「核销」会在报表和工单里各说各话：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>可争议基数（disputable base）</strong>——稽核引擎判定存在计费差异或法定抗辩依据、且仍在申诉窗口内的金额。它是追回率的分母，也是稽核覆盖率的分子。</li>\n<li><strong>减免（mitigation/waiver）</strong>——承运人同意不计收或退还的金额，可能以口头、邮件或正式裁定表达。它是<strong>承诺</strong>，不等于到账。</li>\n<li><strong>贷项通知（credit note）</strong>——承运人开出的、可用来抵扣应付账款的正式凭证，对应 X12 EDI <strong>812</strong> Credit/Debit Adjustment 报文或人工单据。它是「承诺」转为「可入账」的唯一凭据。</li>\n<li><strong>核销（write-off）</strong>——把已确认无法追回的金额从「待追回」如实转入费用科目，并保留原因码。核销不是失败，而是止损与归因。</li>\n<li><strong>成本泄漏（cost leakage）</strong>——本应被追回或被正确归属、却因流程缺口而净损失掉的金额。它不是「管理不善」这种笼统评价，而是下文五类可检测的具体机制。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>其中最关键的一条边界是：<strong>减免是状态，回款是事实，二者之间隔着「凭证」这道闸门</strong>。系统若不把凭证设为关闭工单的强制条件，追回率就只是一串自我安慰的数字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"成本泄漏的五个漏点\">成本泄漏的五个漏点</h2><p>成本泄漏（cost leakage）不是一个笼统的「管理不善」，而是五个可以用数据信号捕捉的具体机制。把它们拆开的价值在于：每个漏点对应不同的检测字段、不同的责任人和不同的控制手段，混在一起就无从下手。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>漏点</th>\n<th>触发信号（可自动检测）</th>\n<th>权威数据来源</th>\n<th>主要控制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>未申诉即过期</td>\n<td>发票状态仍为「待处理」，且距 §541.8 的 30 日窗口剩余 ≤ 3 天</td>\n<td>工单 deadline 字段 + 发票入账日</td>\n<td>倒计时告警、自动升级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>减免承诺未转现金</td>\n<td>工单状态为「已获批准」，但无对应的贷项通知或退款凭证</td>\n<td>承运人对账单、EDI 812</td>\n<td>承诺→凭证的强制绑定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计费错误未追回</td>\n<td>稽核引擎 L3 重算差异 &gt; 阈值，但未立案申诉</td>\n<td>事件事实表、费率表</td>\n<td>差异自动开单</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>预提缺口</td>\n<td>月末预提金额与实际发票金额长期系统性偏离（$\\Delta$ 单向）</td>\n<td>预提台账 + 发票头</td>\n<td>预提模型回归、偏差监控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>转嫁失败</td>\n<td>应由收货人/货代/卡车行承担的 D&amp;D，chargeback 未开出或被拒</td>\n<td>责任归属表、结算单</td>\n<td>责任字段强制、账期联动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这五类里，<strong>减免承诺未转现金</strong>最隐蔽：它造成的不是「少赚」，而是「看起来赚了」。承运人客服在电话里说「这 4 天给你免了」，工单被标记为成功，但如果没有贷项通知，这笔钱实际上被全额计入了应付账款。系统必须把「减免」建模为<strong>需要凭证关闭的状态</strong>，而不是一个可手动勾选的完成标志。</p>\n<p>第二隐蔽的是<strong>转嫁失败</strong>。一家货代替收货人垫付了滞箱费，若不把费用转嫁给实际责任方，泄漏就发生在货代自己的毛利里，而它往往被归类为「客户服务成本」而非「D&amp;D 泄漏」。责任归属的建模见 <a href=\"../dd-charge-regime-commercial-model/dd-liability-attribution-chargeback\">D&amp;D 费用责任归属与转嫁</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"追回率的正确口径-三段漏斗-而非一个比值\">追回率的正确口径：三段漏斗，而非一个比值</h2><p>「追回率是多少」是一个几乎所有团队都会答错的问题，因为没有单一定义能同时表达「是否提出」「是否获准」「是否收到钱」三件事。工程上正确的做法是把它拆成一条<strong>三段漏斗</strong>，每段各自有分子分母，任何一段的衰减都能定位到具体环节。</p>\n<p>设某期间的可争议基数为 $A_{\\text{disputable}}$（稽核引擎判定存在差异或抗辩依据、且在申诉窗口内的金额），则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>file</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>filed</mtext></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>disputable</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>grant</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>granted</mtext></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>filed</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>settle</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>settled</mtext></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>granted</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{file}} = \\frac{A_{\\text{filed}}}{A_{\\text{disputable}}},\\qquad R_{\\text{grant}} = \\frac{A_{\\text{granted}}}{A_{\\text{filed}}},\\qquad R_{\\text{settle}} = \\frac{A_{\\text{settled}}}{A_{\\text{granted}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">file</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">disputable</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">filed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">grant</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">filed</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">granted</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">settle</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">granted</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">settled</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>三个比值的乘积，才是真正的<strong>现金追回率</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>cash</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>file</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>grant</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>settle</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>settled</mtext></msub><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>disputable</mtext></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R_{\\text{cash}} = R_{\\text{file}} \\times R_{\\text{grant}} \\times R_{\\text{settle}} = \\frac{A_{\\text{settled}}}{A_{\\text{disputable}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cash</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">file</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">grant</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">settle</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">disputable</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">settled</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这条乘法关系本身就是诊断工具。若 $R_{\\text{file}}$ 低，问题在内部 SLA 与倒计时管理；若 $R_{\\text{grant}}$ 低，问题在证据包质量（见本系列第二篇）；若 $R_{\\text{settle}}$ 低，问题几乎总是出在「减免承诺未转现金」这个漏点——批准了却没收到凭证。只报一个笼统的追回率，就把三次可定位的失败压缩成一个不可行动的数字。</p>\n<p>分母的选择同样有陷阱。用「D&amp;D 总支出」作分母会稀释真实改善：总支出下降可能只是因为货量减少或拥堵缓解，而非治理变好。用「可争议基数」作分母则聚焦于团队真正能控制的部分。建议在报表上<strong>同时</strong>给出 $R_{\\text{cash}}$ 与 $A_{\\text{disputable}}/A_{\\text{total}}$，前者衡量执行，后者衡量稽核覆盖率——只有边际上「新发现的可争议金额」还在增长，追回率才有可持续性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"追回台账-从主张到核销的状态机\">追回台账：从主张到核销的状态机</h2><p>追回台账（recovery ledger）是整套系统的账本，它的核心不是字段多少，而是<strong>状态迁移必须由凭证触发</strong>，而非由人工判断。一个可审计的状态机如下：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;识别 identified&lt;br/&gt;稽核差异或抗辩命中&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;立案 filed&lt;br/&gt;取得提交回执&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C{&quot;承运人裁定&quot;}&#10;  C --&gt;|&quot;全额/部分减免&quot;| D[&quot;承诺 granted&lt;br/&gt;减免金额已确认&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt;|&quot;驳回&quot;| E[&quot;驳回 rejected&lt;br/&gt;转 FMC 申诉或核销&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; F{&quot;是否取得凭证?&quot;}&#10;  F --&gt;|&quot;贷项通知 EDI 812 / 退款单&quot;| G[&quot;已核销 settled&lt;br/&gt;可入账&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt;|&quot;仅口头/邮件承诺&quot;| H[&quot;挂起 pending&lt;br/&gt;超期升级&quot;]&#10;  H --&gt;|&quot;取得凭证&quot;| G&#10;  H --&gt;|&quot;凭证未到&quot;| I[&quot;核销为坏账 write-off&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; I&#10;  G --&gt; J[&quot;关闭 closed&lt;br/&gt;与总账对账&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"识别 identified&lt;br/&gt;稽核差异或抗辩命中\"] --&gt; B[\"立案 filed&lt;br/&gt;取得提交回执\"]\n  B --&gt; C{\"承运人裁定\"}\n  C --&gt;|\"全额/部分减免\"| D[\"承诺 granted&lt;br/&gt;减免金额已确认\"]\n  C --&gt;|\"驳回\"| E[\"驳回 rejected&lt;br/&gt;转 FMC 申诉或核销\"]\n  D --&gt; F{\"是否取得凭证?\"}\n  F --&gt;|\"贷项通知 EDI 812 / 退款单\"| G[\"已核销 settled&lt;br/&gt;可入账\"]\n  F --&gt;|\"仅口头/邮件承诺\"| H[\"挂起 pending&lt;br/&gt;超期升级\"]\n  H --&gt;|\"取得凭证\"| G\n  H --&gt;|\"凭证未到\"| I[\"核销为坏账 write-off\"]\n  E --&gt; I\n  G --&gt; J[\"关闭 closed&lt;br/&gt;与总账对账\"]</pre><p>关键约束有三条。其一，<strong>「立案」必须有提交回执</strong>（承运人门户的确认编号或书面回执），否则无法证明在窗口内提交过——这是 §541.8(a) 赋予的 30 日权利的唯一凭据。其二，<strong>「已核销」只能由凭证触发</strong>：美国政府层面的合规要求里，承运人的减免既可以表现为贷项通知（X12 EDI <strong>812</strong> Credit/Debit Adjustment，或人工 credit note），也可以表现为退款；两者都必须与工单一一绑定，方可从「承诺」进入「已核销」。其三，<strong>「驳回」不等于终点</strong>：驳回后的下一站是联邦海事委员会（FMC）的 charge complaint 程序（46 U.S.C. § 41310，由 2022 年《海洋运输改革法案》OSRA 2022, Pub. L. 117-146 新增），或者内部核销。</p>\n<p>核销（write-off）不是失败的对立面，而是<strong>如实入账</strong>。一笔已确认无法追回的金额，若长期挂在「应收减免」科目下，会同时虚增资产和虚增追回率。正确的做法是在明确的期限规则下（例如驳回后 90 天、或凭证请求无回应 60 天）把它从「待追回」核销为费用，并保留原因码，供后续的泄漏分析归因。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预提-让成本落在正确的会计期间\">预提：让成本落在正确的会计期间</h2><p>D&amp;D 的成本确认有一个天然的时间错配：费用在集装箱停止流转的那一天就已发生，但承运人可以被允许在 <strong>30 个日历日</strong>内才开出发票。46 CFR § 541.7(a) 规定，开票方必须在「费用最后累计之日」起 30 个日历日内开票，否则被开票方<strong>无需支付</strong>该费用。这意味着月末结账时，必然存在一批「已发生但未收到发票」的 D&amp;D 成本——不预提，就会落在下一个会计期间，形成跨期的利润表冲击。</p>\n<p>预提金额按箱级累加，对每个仍在免费期之外、尚未收到发票的集装箱：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>accrual</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>c</mi></munder><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>D</mi><mrow><mtext>elapsed</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A_{\\text{accrual}} = \\sum_{c} \\max\\!\\left(0,\\; D_{\\text{elapsed},c} - F_c\\right) \\times r_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">accrual</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.9em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.25em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">elapsed</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 $D_{\\text{elapsed},c}$ 是箱 $c$ 截至结账日已流逝的计费天数，$F_c$ 是其合同或 tariff 赋予的免费期天数，$r_c$ 是适用设备的日费率。免费期天数的确定见 <a href=\"../free-time-clock-event-tracking/dd-clock-model-container-event-timeline\">免费期时钟模型与全生命周期事件时间线</a>。</p>\n<p>预提的质量用<strong>预提偏差</strong>衡量。对每个已开票的箱子，比较其实际发票金额与当初的预提：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>c</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mtext>invoice</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mrow><mtext>accrual</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_c = A_{\\text{invoice},c} - A_{\\text{accrual},c}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">invoice</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">accrual</span></span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>若 $E[\\Delta]$ 长期显著为正，说明预提系统性不足——通常是模型漏掉了延误（例如码头未放箱导致的额外天数）；若显著为负，则虚增了负债，两种偏差都要进回归修正。按箱聚合预提偏差并追踪其分布，是比「预提总额对不对」灵敏得多的监控。值得注意的是，§ 541.7 的 30 天开票期限本身就是一个<strong>预提窗口的上界</strong>：超过 30 天仍未开票且未被豁免的金额，应当在预提台账中转入「无需支付」的冲回，而非无限期挂账。</p>\n<h2 id=\"供应商对账-三单匹配与贷项通知账龄\">供应商对账：三单匹配与贷项通知账龄</h2><p>追回的最后一道闸门是<strong>供应商对账（supplier reconciliation）</strong>——把内部台账与承运人出具的对账单（statement）逐笔核对。仅靠对总额会发现不了单笔错配，因此对账应按「三单匹配」组织：内部工单、承运人贷项通知/退款凭证、以及总账中的实际过账，三者以箱号加发票号为主键连接。</p>\n<p>对账中最容易出问题的是<strong>贷项通知账龄</strong>。贷项通知是一张独立的凭证，承运人开出后不一定立即在下一张账单中抵扣，可能挂在承运人侧的应收科目里等待货主主动使用。若内部只跟踪工单状态而不跟踪凭证是否被实际使用，就会出现「账上号称追回、实际从未抵扣」的假追回。工程上应把贷项通知作为独立实体建模，记录开出日、金额、适用发票号、以及被抵扣的日期，并对超过约定账期仍未使用的凭证发起催办。</p>\n<p>对账频率应与业务量匹配：高货量客户按月，低货量可按季，但<strong>每张争议工单关闭前必须完成一次该笔的对账</strong>，否则关闭只是纸面动作。对账差异本身也是泄漏信号——系统性单向差异（始终是内部台账高于承运人确认额）通常指向稽核引擎的阈值或口径需要重新校准。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;内部追回台账&quot;] --&gt; M{&quot;三单匹配&lt;br/&gt;箱号 + 发票号&quot;}&#10;  B[&quot;承运人对账单 / 贷项通知 EDI 812&quot;] --&gt; M&#10;  C[&quot;总账实际过账&quot;] --&gt; M&#10;  M --&gt;|&quot;三者一致&quot;| D[&quot;对账通过&lt;br/&gt;工单可关闭&quot;]&#10;  M --&gt;|&quot;凭证未抵扣&quot;| E[&quot;贷项通知账龄告警&lt;br/&gt;发起催办&quot;]&#10;  M --&gt;|&quot;金额不一致&quot;| F[&quot;差异归因&lt;br/&gt;校准稽核阈值/口径&quot;]&#10;  M --&gt;|&quot;仅内部有记录&quot;| G[&quot;疑似虚追回&lt;br/&gt;回退工单状态&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"内部追回台账\"] --&gt; M{\"三单匹配&lt;br/&gt;箱号 + 发票号\"}\n  B[\"承运人对账单 / 贷项通知 EDI 812\"] --&gt; M\n  C[\"总账实际过账\"] --&gt; M\n  M --&gt;|\"三者一致\"| D[\"对账通过&lt;br/&gt;工单可关闭\"]\n  M --&gt;|\"凭证未抵扣\"| E[\"贷项通知账龄告警&lt;br/&gt;发起催办\"]\n  M --&gt;|\"金额不一致\"| F[\"差异归因&lt;br/&gt;校准稽核阈值/口径\"]\n  M --&gt;|\"仅内部有记录\"| G[\"疑似虚追回&lt;br/&gt;回退工单状态\"]</pre><h2 id=\"kpi-与治理-把漏点变成可监控的指标\">KPI 与治理：把漏点变成可监控的指标</h2><p>治理的落点是一组<strong>可归因到漏点</strong>的指标，而不是一个综合评分。建议至少维护以下常设指标：可争议基数 $A_{\\text{disputable}}$（稽核覆盖率）、三个漏斗比值 $R_{\\text{file}}, R_{\\text{grant}}, R_{\\text{settle}}$、预提偏差 $E[\\Delta]$ 及其分布、贷项通知账龄分布、以及核销坏账率。每个指标都应绑定一个责任角色和一条处置动作，否则监控毫无意义。</p>\n<p>监管环境在 2026 年仍持续收紧，这直接影响治理的紧迫性。2024 年 5 月 28 日生效的《Demurrage and Detention Billing Requirements》最终规则（<strong>46 CFR Part 541</strong>，89 FR 14362，2024-02-26 发布，见 fmc.gov 与 ecfr.gov）把发票内容、开票时限、异议与减免请求时限都变成了硬性要求；其中 § 541.6(e) 要求开票方在发票上声明其自身履约「未导致或促成」所计费用——这一句认证本身就是追回阶段的杠杆，因为若承运人无法证明其履约无过错，减免主张的举证责任就更偏向货主一方。同时，FMC 在 2026 年 7 月 8 日的上诉裁决中重申，滞箱费必须服务于促进货物流转的目的（D.C. Circuit 维持 FMC 关于港口三天关闭期间对卡车行计费的裁定，见 fmc.gov 新闻室 2026-07-08）。当内部申诉在承运人处反复驳回、且证据链完整时，向 FMC 提交 charge complaint 是制度化的最后手段，而非情绪化升级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>本篇的最终产出不是「追回了多少钱」，而是<strong>一张能说明钱去了哪里、又从哪里漏掉的账</strong>。落到执行，收敛为三条纪律：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>凭证关门</strong>——只有承运人的贷项通知（EDI 812）或退款凭证到达，工单才能从「已获批准」进入「已核销」；口头减免一律进挂起队列并设升级倒计时。这条规则直接消灭最隐蔽的漏点「减免承诺未转现金」。</li>\n<li><strong>漏斗分开报</strong>——分别追踪 $R_{\\text{file}}, R_{\\text{grant}}, R_{\\text{settle}}$ 三段比值，而非一个总追回率；分母用可争议基数，并并列汇报稽核覆盖率 $A_{\\text{disputable}}/A_{\\text{total}}$，避免用货量波动掩盖执行变化。</li>\n<li><strong>预提与对账闭环</strong>——按箱累加预提、监控预提偏差 $E[\\Delta]$ 的分布，并以「箱号 + 发票号」为主键做三单匹配与贷项通知账龄管理；超过 46 CFR § 541.7 的 30 天开票窗口仍未开票的金额，冲回「无需支付」而非无限挂账。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>识别与重算在上述 <a href=\"dd-invoice-data-model-audit-rules\">账单数据模型</a> 中完成，申诉与举证在 <a href=\"dd-dispute-filing-evidence-package\">争议申诉流程</a> 中完成，而追回、预提、核销与对账在此收口——四者合起来，才构成一个闭环的 D&amp;D 成本治理系统。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"费用追回、核销与成本泄漏分析（追回率/预提/供应商对账）","id":"费用追回-核销与成本泄漏分析-追回率-预提-供应商对账"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：五个先对齐的术语","id":"核心概念-五个先对齐的术语"},{"level":2,"text":"成本泄漏的五个漏点","id":"成本泄漏的五个漏点"},{"level":2,"text":"追回率的正确口径：三段漏斗，而非一个比值","id":"追回率的正确口径-三段漏斗-而非一个比值"},{"level":2,"text":"追回台账：从主张到核销的状态机","id":"追回台账-从主张到核销的状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"预提：让成本落在正确的会计期间","id":"预提-让成本落在正确的会计期间"},{"level":2,"text":"供应商对账：三单匹配与贷项通知账龄","id":"供应商对账-三单匹配与贷项通知账龄"},{"level":2,"text":"KPI 与治理：把漏点变成可监控的指标","id":"kpi-与治理-把漏点变成可监控的指标"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"争议申诉流程设计与证据包构建（申诉窗口/承运人门户/SLA）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/container-demurrage-detention-port-cost-management/invoice-audit-dispute-recovery/dd-dispute-filing-evidence-package"},"next":{"title":"拥堵驱动因素与港口队列/停留时长度量模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/container-demurrage-detention-port-cost-management/congestion-cost-prediction-operations/congestion-drivers-port-dwell-model"}}